tchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mn>0.01</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0.01</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0.01</mn><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>≈</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.01</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.01</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.01</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>≈</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.01</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.01</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.01</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>≈</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2.01</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> </p>\n</div></div>",
